ttps://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982617_252534300002512_88477822051553422_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TnHgCvlWw3gQ7kNvwEUNvwu&_nc_oc=AdoApOGk5Aso98P2Jc-z3acBzlj0LMK3UaTFM_XgX5v_lPFObMFApGtz3ix24x37s5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ybFUU82D2Vk0Kyy9CGv4OTSUS15MLmcDdpOhOfdHvZA&oe=6A36C53D"}, {"file_name": "Zombieland_Office_Quest_2.png", "id": "637533130512612", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982535_637533133845945_4913826446620039560_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2oxyURDtjxgQ7kNvwE2jQby&_nc_oc=Adq9kTSiLihf5R7DPvk9zOuHTSUaE7uSjqHz969564GaPzJ7mAtZGySe2tv6oX7x0hA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-CnLLJ538tkiHn9liezxdS6YMUnKoFAz9o5ZRw101hwg&oe=6A36BA22"}, {"file_name": "Zombieland_Family_Home_Quest_2.png", "id": "2864214510561781", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_2864214513895114_2819262369100977508_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lHEaQgIs0aUQ7kNvwHlcSae&_nc_oc=Adpbm7A90szUc_ZB0tddthLYJbbSs19bEn1UkaeoHxOW-9hLh9WrxMSd9616ii-tIOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8aGus9G827fZElKSXbjJRD-NFOcsXQgv5NrUBJf37RiQ&oe=6A369558"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ZL_HSF_Meta_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1141846950667714", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393523_1141846954001047_2789278163877689417_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0dRXjvgpRt8Q7kNvwGIIGrg&_nc_oc=AdqG5kxbG1DoJThvOXp19R34mhqQvbGfOAsGyvuJiO7o1Bd7tVg5eEIgEwckoueIT4A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-3Pr_RVdTKU74_mML_Q78qDSp4WpXpznax3Gfd-oMjPA&oe=6A369F94"}, "display_name": "Zombieland: Headshot Fever", "keywords": ["Shooter", "FPS", "zombies", "Zombieland", "Arcade"], "long_description": "** VR Game of the Year finalist at TIGA Awards **\n** VR Game of the Year finalist at VR Awards **\n** Winner of 'Best Small Studio' at the TIGA Awards **\n\nThe award-winning Zombieland: Headshot Fever is an arcade light-gun game built for VR.\n\nThis zombie-killing race sport brings light-gun games into the 21st century! Headshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy.\n\nFEATURES:\n{958104066384162}\nBullet Time - Two headshots turn the world slow!\n{1132267338685310}\nLeaderboards - Challenge the world!\n{1038303291795263}\nWeapons - Unlock and upgrade a range of weapons!\n{609884205110187}\nThe Zombieland Invitational - The zombie-killing race course of your nightmares!\n{1794959568031203}\nArcade Mode - a new roguelite experience!\n\nAccolades:\n- \"Insanely addictive\" - VRFocus\n- \u201cThe gameplay is incredibly fun and really addictive\u201d - BMF VR\n- \"Arcade head blasting fun\" - Beardo Benjo\n- \u201cThe headshot slowmo is seriously addictive\u201d - Cerberusarms\n- \"A joy to play\u201d - Platinum Award, Thumb Culture", "short_description": "** VR Game of the Year finalist - VR Awards **\n** VR Game of the Year finalist - TIGA Awards **\n\n\"Insanely addictive\" - VRFocus\n\u201cThe gameplay is incredibly fun and really addictive\u201d - BMF VR\n\"Arcade head blasting fun\" - Beardo Benjo\n\nThe award-winning Zombieland: Headshot Fever is an arcade light gun game built for VR.\n\nHeadshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy."}]}, "developer_name": "XR Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xrgames.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XR Games / Sony Pictures Virtual Reality (SPVR)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.zombielandvrgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "274332603